Fixes: 54b48080278a ("drm/mediatek: Add mediatek-drm of vdosys0 support for mt8188")
Signed-off-by: Jason-JH.Lin <jason-jh.lin@mediatek.com>
Reviewed-by: CK Hu <ck.hu@mediatek.com>
